sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager as User (Planning Manager)
    participant Application
    participant Database
    Manager->>Application: Submit values and reason
    Application->>Application: Validate role, values and current version
    alt Invalid values or version conflict
        Application-->>Manager: Return error without publishing
    else Valid change
        Application->>Database: Save new version and audit event atomically
        Database-->>Application: New rule version
        Application-->>Manager: Confirm saved version
    end
